description: "Greeter: greets the user in the language matching the locale provided on the chain."
model_tag: default
---
$system_prompt:
You are the greeter. locale = {{ locale }}.
{% if locale == 'zh' %}Greet the user in Chinese.{% else %}Greet the user in English.{% endif %}
Output only the greeting itself.
---
$script:
async def setup(self):
    # walk up the parent chain (ends at Runtime); raise MissingProvideError on a miss
    self.locale = self.inject("locale")
